{
  "notes": [
    "inScope: true means the indexed GST guidance (ird.govt.nz/gst) answers the question; false means the system should say it cannot answer.",
    "Questions marked notInCorpus are real GST questions whose answers sit outside the /gst section of the IRD site, so an honest system should decline them.",
    "expectPages are paths of pages that answer the question. A question counts as found if any of them is in the top 5 search results.",
    "expectFacts must appear in the answer. They were checked against the snapshot taken on 11 October 2026.",
    "Questions marked holdout were written after the search settings were tuned and were not used for tuning. Retrieval scores on them are reported separately."
